Subdomain CourseCatalog of TeachingAndLearning
documentation "A Course entity represents the definition of the course, its characteristics, and its mapping to LearningStandards. A course may be defined a state, LEA or school level. The CourseOffering entity represents a course that is offered by a school during a session. The CourseOffering will have a LocalCourseCode and may have a LocalCourseTitle."
